able>\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"innerpadding bodycopy\" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n              <strong style=\"color:#164f7b\">A. BloomKite for Creating Micro Websites: </strong>Financial\r\n              Advisors can create micro websites to promote products & services with better digital\r\n              Identification.\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"innerpadding bodycopy\" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n              <strong style=\"color:#164f7b\">B. BloomKite for Digital Transformations:</strong> Meaningful customer engagement by addressing queries, planning\r\n              and scheme recommendations on the track & trace method.\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"innerpadding bodycopy\" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n              <strong style=\"color:#164f7b\"> C. BloomKite for Sharing of Knowledge:</strong> Educate and create awareness through article postings and content\r\n              sharing. Get validated and rewarded for the knowledge sharing with the highest profile score.\r\n\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"innerpadding bodycopy borderbottom\" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n              <strong style=\"color:#164f7b\"> D. BloomKite for Good use of Digital Tools:</strong> Reach out clients with digital tools for creating financial\r\n              profile, Risk profile and use financial calculators for professional advice.\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"innerpadding bodycopy borderbottom\">\r\n              Together let us create a Hybrid Advisor Portal with modern day experience.\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"innerpadding bodycopy borde