=\"bodycopy\">\r\n										<table>\r\n											<tbody>\r\n												<tr>\r\n													<td style=\"padding-bottom: 15px\">Dear Palani R,</td>\r\n												</tr>\r\n												<tr>\r\n													<td class=\"innerpadding\" style=\"padding: 0 0 15px 0;\">\r\n														Warm Greetings from BloomKite....</td>\r\n												</tr>\r\n												<tr>\r\n													<td style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">Thank you for\r\n														verifying your mail ID and proceeding for profile creation\r\n														at <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.bloomkite.com\">www.bloomkite.com</a>\r\n													</td>\r\n												</tr>\r\n												<tr>\r\n													<td style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">We are happy to\r\n														inform you as prospective investor how you can make use of\r\n														the portal for better experience.</td>\r\n												</tr>\r\n												<tr>\r\n													<td class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"heading\">A.\r\n															BloomKite for Finding Expert Advisors: </span> Financial\r\n														Advisors with valid certifications and experience are\r\n														available in BloomKite. Investors can find a suitable\r\n														advisor on the basis of product expertise or location.</td>\r\n												</tr>\r\n												<tr>\r\n													<td class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"heading\">B.\r\n															BloomKite for Financial Advice:</span> Investors can take\r\n														Financial Advice from expert advisors by posting queries\r\n														and also by sharing financial planning sheets.</td>\r\n												</tr>\r\n												<tr>\r\n													<td class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"heading\">C.\r\n															BloomKite for Sharing of Knowledge:</span> Expert Advisor will\r\n														be sharing their knowledge by posting articles and other\r\n														related contents. Investor can have better awareness by\r\n														following advisors.</td>\r\n												</tr>\r\n												<tr>\r\n													<td class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"heading\">D.\r\n															BloomKite for Digital Transformations:</span> Meaningful\r\n														engagement with advisors for investor’s queries, financial\r\n														planning and scheme recommendations on track & trace\r\n														method.</td>\r\n												</tr>\r\n\r\n											</tbody>\r\n										</table>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n							</table>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n\r\n					<td class=\"outerpadding bodycopy borderbottom\">Together let us\r\n						create Hybrid Advisor Portal with modern day experience.</td>\r\n\r\n					<!-- <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"innerpadding borderbottom\">\r\n              <table width=\"115\" align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <td height=\"115\" style=\"padding: 0 20px 20px 0;\">\r\n                    <img class=\"fix\"\r\n                      src=\"http://bloomkite-ui-prod-341294227.us-east-2.elb.amazonaws.com/images/favicon.png\"\r\n                      width=\"115\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />\r\n                  </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n              </table> -->\r\n					<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\r\n            <table width=\"380\" align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td>\r\n          <![endif]-->\r\n					<!-- <table class=\"col380\" align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"\r\n                style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 380px;\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                  <td>\r\n                    <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n                      <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"bodycopy\">\r\n                          We request you to click the link below to verify your email ID and proceed further to create\r\n                          your Advisor profile.\r\n   